exports[`the generic kind-value layout lays out plan_page_outline from its schema 1`] = `"<section class="matrx-pl"><h2 class="matrx-pl-title">Page Placement</h2><dl class="matrx-pl-kv"><dt>Differentiator</dt><dd>This is the only page that explains what runner&#39;s knee is and how it is assessed; every sibling page is either a different condition or a different service.</dd></dl><h3>Covers</h3><ul><li>What patellofemoral pain is, in plain language</li><li>The upstream causes at the hip and foot</li><li>What the first assessment involves</li><li>Realistic recovery timelines for returning to running</li></ul><h3>Defer to</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Topic</th><th>To route</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fees and insurance coverage</td><td>/fees</td></tr><tr><td>Our therapists</td><td>/about/team</td></tr><tr><td>Return-to-sport testing protocols</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Internal links</h3><table><thead><tr><th>To route</th><th>Anchor text</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>/services/running-assessment</td><td>running assessment</td><td>The natural next step for a reader who recognizes their symptoms here.</td></tr><tr><td>/fees</td><td>what an assessment costs</td><td>Answers the question this page deliberately does not, without breaking the boundary.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Must not cover</h3><ul><li>General pricing and insurance questions</li><li>The clinic&#39;s staff credentials and philosophy</li><li>Post-surgical knee rehabilitation, which is a different pathway entirely</li></ul><h3>Uncovered gaps</h3><ul><li>Return-to-sport testing protocols — the plan wants this subject and no page has claimed it.</li></ul></section>"`;

